// Wield is OSRS's, and so are the manwear/womanwear above, but chinchompa combat - a thrown
// explosive with its own splash and its own three attack styles - does not exist here yet, and a
// wieldable obj with no weapon category would fight as a punch. Commented out until it does.
// iop2=Wield

